@1 = ~As much as I'd love to erase the rivvin from the surface, they do some good. Flour, for instance. We use bluecap mushrooms instead, but they compare naught to surface flour. If you have any goods from above, for whatever reason, I might purchase them.~
@2 = ~I have some bread. Will you pay 50 gold for it?~
@3 = ~I have some flour. Will you pay 3000 gold for it?~
@4 = ~I have some grain. Will you pay 1200 gold for it?~
@5 = ~I have some honey. Will you pay 5000 gold for it?~
@6 = ~I have some cookies. Will you pay 899 gold for it?~
@7 = ~Then be gone, rivvil.~
